{"version":1,"name":"SAVE\\SAVGAME.DAT","data":"","leads":[{"id":"council-commissions","title":"Council commissions","detail":"Rolf says to read the proclamations at City Hall and ask the clerk about commissions."},{"id":"phlan-training-schools","title":"Training in New Phlan","detail":"Rolf showed the party where adventurers train. Return to the training schools when a character is ready to advance."},{"id":"harbor-trade","title":"The sea lanes","detail":"Rolf says few ships risk the passage and the council wants to reopen it."},{"id":"proclamation-lxiv","title":"Proclamation LXIV","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-lxxviii","title":"Proclamation LXXVIII","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-cix","title":"Proclamation CIX","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-lix","title":"Proclamation LIX","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"passage-sokal","title":"Passage to Sokal Keep","detail":"The harbor master says you can reach the keep by boat."},{"id":"sokal-arrival","title":"Arrival at Sokal Keep","detail":"The party landed on Thorn Island."},{"id":"sokal-reeds","title":"Reeds by the keep gate","detail":"The party saw a mound of reeds west of the gates."},{"id":"sokal-parchment","title":"The parchment at Sokal Keep","detail":"The party found a damaged scroll on a dead elf outside the keep."},{"id":"sokal-patrol-passed","title":"Sokal Keep patrol","detail":"The undead patrol accepted the word and let the party pass."},{"id":"sokal-ferran","title":"Ferran Martinez","detail":"Ferran is bound to guard the keep and asks whether Phlan has been freed."},{"id":"sokal-ambush","title":"Sokal courtyard ambush","detail":"A large force of orcs and hobgoblins rushed the party through the courtyard door."},{"id":"sokal-courtyard-note","title":"Note from the courtyard","detail":"The party found a note on a fallen hobgoblin and copied it as journal entry 57."},{"id":"sokal-chapel","title":"Sokal Keep chapel","detail":"The party found the remains of two orcs in the doorway and a large altar against the south wall."},{"id":"sokal-pale-form","title":"The keep's pale figure","detail":"A pale figure appeared inside the keep. The party can try speaking to it."},{"id":"sokal-phlan-fall","title":"Ferran's account of Phlan's fall","detail":"Ferran said creatures empowered by a magical pool overran Phlan. He named Tyranthraxus, Edranka, and Torath as their leaders."},{"id":"sokal-mendor","title":"Mendor's lost histories","detail":"Ferran says Mendor gathered accounts of the powers that brought down Phlan. His library was overrun."},{"id":"sokal-armory","title":"Sokal Keep armory","detail":"Ferran says help lies beyond an illusory wall in the armory."},{"id":"sokal-departure","title":"Ferran's password","detail":"Ferran told the party to say SAMOSUD to his guards on the way out."},{"id":"journal-entry-57","title":"Journal entry 57","detail":"The party encountered a reference to entry 57 in the Adventurer's Journal."}],"party":{"SAVE\\CHRDATE1.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATE1.ITM":"C0NoYWluIE1haWwgIE1haWwgICAgICAgICAgICA3NQAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADcAMDcAAAEAACwBAEsAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATE1.SPC":"WgAA/wAIALw5YQAA/wAIAIg8GgAA/wAIAJI8LwAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATE2.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATE2.ITM":"C0NoYWluIE1haWwgIE1haWwgICAgICAgICAgICA3NQAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADcAMDcAAAEAACwBAEsAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATE2.SPC":"WgAA/wAIAK48YQAA/wAIAK88GgAA/wAIALA8LwAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATE3.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATE3.ITM":"C0NoYWluIE1haWwgIE1haWwgICAgICAgICAgICA3NQAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADcAMDcAAAEAACwBAEsAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATE3.SPC":"WgAA/wAIAMg8YQAA/wAIAMk8GgAA/wAIAMo8LwAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATE4.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATE4.ITM":"C0NoYWluIE1haWwgIE1haWwgICAgICAgICAgICA3NQAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADcAMDcAAAEAACwBA